; AudioDSPGraph native nfnp/wire grammar, as used by the donor Generic VAD.
; HAL controls volume; the measured TAS/AudioReach VI path protects both amps.
graphName nezha_playback

in in
out out
box NFP nfnp 1 1
format pcm (48000 2)
wire (in 0) (NFP 0) pcm
wire (NFP 0) (out 0) pcm
